target: internal/mutate/mutate.go
verify: go test ./internal/mutate/ -count=1 -run 'TestTailFallbackWindowIsExactlyTheLastNLines'
expect: window starts one line off
why:    the fallback window shifted one line later, dropping the line that should have been its first — invisible to a test that only checks the LAST line of output is present
--- old
	start := len(lines) - tailLines // the end, where a crash message lands
--- new
	start := len(lines) - tailLines + 1 // the end, where a crash message lands
